---
// Production slot for Toast's "Website widget" (Toast Web > Waitlist & Reservations > Settings > Reservations).
// The snippet comes from the venue's own Toast account and is NOT invented here. Until it is pasted below, the demo journey runs.
// To go live: paste Toast's snippet into the <Fragment set:html> below as a single-quoted string (or move to <script is:inline>),
// allow Toast's script/frame origins in the site's CSP, and update the cookie notice if the script sets cookies.
const snippet = ''; // shortcut: empty until the venue's Toast Tables widget snippet is supplied
---
{snippet
  ? <div data-toast-widget><Fragment set:html={snippet} /></div>
  : <div class="widget-slot" role="note"><h3>Toast booking widget – not connected</h3>
      <p>In production, Toast's own reservation widget sits here (opening a booking window on top of this page), so guests book real availability without leaving the site. The venue's snippet is needed first.</p></div>}
